  "title": "Kusuriya no Hitorigoto (2025)",
  "justification": "AniDB specials S1-S22 \"Maomao no Hitorigoto Episode 25-46\" (2025-01-13 to 2025-06-16) are TVDB season 0 episodes 25-46 \"Maomao's Diaries 25 (Calico Cat)\" to \"46 (Hairpin)\" on the same dates, S23 and S24 \"Special Edition Part 1/2\" are episodes 47 and 48 \"Let's Investigate USJ Part One/Two\", and S25 \"Episode 47 Tomodachi\" and S26 \"Episode 48 Kamen\" are 49 \"(Friends)\" and 50 \"(Masks)\". By default they fell on the first season's shorts. S27, the Abema special, and S28, the climax pre-broadcast special, have no TVDB episode. TMDB 220542 season 0 lists the same shorts as episodes 25-50 (\"The Maomao Diaries: Calico Cat\" to \"Masks\", same dates), so the row names TMDB season 0 too.",
